                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">5c09f241-a68e-4b79-9ef8-4079a9b1f1d4</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 2  -  Points around the top
Goal: the same number of points around the twisted top.
Idea: Same count as the base, so point i at the base pairs with
   point i at the top.
Watch for: Use the same slider for both, or the lines will skip.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
