                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 4  -  Give mullions thickness
Goal: round mullions around every line.
Idea: Pipe sweeps a circle along a curve.
Watch for: The radius is in feet: 0.25 ft = 3 in.
Wire check: radius slider -&gt; R.</item>
                  </items>
